<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Alpha Since — Ma préparation</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="icon" href="/img/logo.png">
<style>#dc-root .sc-host>*{margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important}@media (max-width:420px){#dc-root .sc-host>*{width:100vw!important;max-width:100vw}}</style>
<script src="/support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&amp;family=Roboto+Condensed:wght@400;500;700&amp;family=Caveat:wght@600&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
body{margin:0;background:#12110C;font-family:'Roboto Condensed','Arial Narrow',system-ui,sans-serif}
a{color:#F2E415}a:hover{color:#FFFFFF}
input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,input::-webkit-inner-spin-button{-webkit-appearance:none;margin:0}
input[type=number]{-moz-appearance:textfield}
input{color:#12110C;-webkit-text-fill-color:#12110C;caret-color:#12110C}
input:focus{outline:3px solid #F2E415;outline-offset:1px;border-color:#12110C}
</style>
</helmet>
<div style="width: 390px; height: 5600px; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: {{pageBg}}; color: {{pageFg}}; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', system-ui, sans-serif; overflow: hidden">
<header style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr 44px; align-items: center; padding: 12px 20px; background: #807C3A; color: #12110C">
<button onClick="{{toggleMenu}}" aria-label="Ouvrir le menu" aria-expanded="{{menuOpen}}" style="justify-self: start; width: 44px; height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: transparent; border: 0; cursor: pointer; padding: 0">
<svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#12110C" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="4" y1="7" x2="20" y2="7"></line><line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" y1="17" x2="20" y2="17"></line></svg>
</button>
<a href="Main.dc.html" aria-label="Alpha Since, accueil" style="display: flex; text-decoration: none; justify-self: center"><img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Alpha Since 1982" style="height: 92px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; display: block"></a>
<a href="Main.dc.html#manique" aria-label="Boutique" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; justify-self: end">
<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#12110C" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 4h2l2.4 10.2a1 1 0 0 0 1 .8h8.9a1 1 0 0 0 1-.8L20 8H6.2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1.4"></circle><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1.4"></circle></svg>
</a>
</header>
<sc-if value="{{menuOpen}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
<nav aria-label="Menu principal" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 20; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; padding: 14px 20px 32px; background: #12110C; color: #E4E1B8; border-bottom: 4px solid #F2E415">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center">
<a href="Main.dc.html#top" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" aria-label="Alpha Since, accueil" style="display: flex"><img src="/img/logo-alt.png" alt="Alpha Since 1982" style="height: 60px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; display: block"></a>
<button onClick="{{closeMenu}}" aria-label="Fermer le menu" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: transparent; border: 2px solid #807C3A; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; padding: 0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E4E1B8" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line></svg></button>
</div>
<a href="Test.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 54px; background: #F2E415; color: #12110C; font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none">Faire mon test physique</a>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">S'entraîner</span><a href="Test.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Test physique</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">7 tests reconnus et ton bilan</span></a><a href="Programme.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Ma préparation</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Audit, objectif et programme complet</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#outils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Charge max, chrono, disques</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#outils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Quiz : quel matos pour toi ?</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#outils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Playlists Fun, Boost, Chill</span></a></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Récupérer</span><a href="Main.dc.html#recuperer" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Quand s’étirer ?</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#recuperer" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Routine souplesse 10 min</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Guidée au chrono</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#sommeil" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Mieux dormir</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Mini-audit sommeil</span></a></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Bien manger</span><a href="Main.dc.html#quiz" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Quiz nutrition</span></a><a href="Programme.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Plan alimentaire</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Juste après ton audit</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#manger" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Calculateur d’hydratation</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#manger" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Compléments : ce qui marche</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Boutique</span><a href="Main.dc.html#manique" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Manique X-Trm Confort</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">34,95 €</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#manique" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Sangle et poignet de force</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Bientôt disponibles</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Coaching</span><a href="Suivi.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Suivi personnalisé</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Sport ou sport + diététique, sans engagement</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Conseils</span><a href="Main.dc.html#conseils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Débuter</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#conseils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Mains et grip</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#conseils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Progresser</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Alpha</span><a href="Main.dc.html#quisommesnous" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Qui sommes-nous ?</span></a><a href="Main.dc.html#contact" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Prendre contact</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 16px; font-size: 14px"><a href="#mentions" style="color: #A8A36A; min-height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center">Mentions légales</a><a href="#cgv" style="color: #A8A36A; min-height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center">CGV</a><a href="#confidentialite" style="color: #A8A36A; min-height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center">Confidentialité</a></div>
</nav>
</sc-if>
<sc-if value="{{showProgress}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 18px 20px 0">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4A4620"><span>{{stepLabel}}</span><span>{{stepCount}}</span></div>
<div style="height: 6px; background: #C9C49A; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden"><div style="height: 6px; width: {{progressW}}; background: #F2E415"></div></div>
</div>
</sc-if>
<main style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; padding: 24px 20px 40px">
<sc-if value="{{isIntro}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415">Outil Alpha · Multisport</div>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 56px; line-height: 0.98; text-transform: uppercase; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1.6px #E4E1B8">Crée ta préparation</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5">Semi, marathon, trail, muscle, explosivité ou force pure : on part de là où tu es vraiment, pas de là où tu aimerais être. Et on te dit honnêtement combien de temps il faudra.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; background: #1C1B13; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; color: #F2E415; width: 24px">1</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #FFFFFF">Ton audit</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Âge, taille, poids, niveau actuel.</span></div></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; background: #1C1B13; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; color: #F2E415; width: 24px">2</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #FFFFFF">Un test express</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Pompes, gainage, course. Cinq minutes, promis.</span></div></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; background: #1C1B13; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; color: #F2E415; width: 24px">3</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #FFFFFF">Ton objectif</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Endurance, muscle, force ou tout simplement la forme.</span></div></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; background: #1C1B13; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; color: #F2E415; width: 24px">4</span><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #FFFFFF">Ton engagement</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Combien de séances par semaine, pour de vrai.</span></div></div>
</div>
<button onClick="{{next}}" style="min-height: 56px; background: #F2E415; color: #12110C; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif">Commencer mon audit</button>
</div>
</sc-if>
<sc-if value="{{isAudit}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; color: #12110C">Qui es-tu ?</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45">Pas de jugement, juste des chiffres pour calibrer ton plan. Ajuste avec le curseur ou les boutons − et +.</p>
<sc-for list="{{auditNums}}" as="nf" hint-placeholder-count="3">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #C9C49A; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px">
<label for="{{nf.id}}" style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #12110C">{{nf.label}}</label>
<span aria-live="polite" style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; color: #12110C; white-space: nowrap">{{nf.display}}</span>
</div>
<sc-if value="{{nf.hasDesc}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}"><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #12110C">{{nf.desc}}</span></sc-if>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center">
<button aria-label="{{nf.minusLabel}}" onClick="{{nf.minus}}" style="width: 52px; height: 52px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; background: #E4E1B8; color: #12110C; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer">−</button>
<input id="{{nf.id}}" type="range" min="{{nf.min}}" max="{{nf.max}}" step="{{nf.step}}" value="{{nf.value}}" onChange="{{nf.onRange}}" style="flex-grow: 1; min-width: 0; height: 44px; accent-color: #12110C">
<button aria-label="{{nf.plusLabel}}" onClick="{{nf.plus}}" style="width: 52px; height: 52px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; background: #E4E1B8; color: #12110C; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer">+</button>
</div>
</div>
</sc-for>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700">Sexe (pour calibrer le test de pompes)</span>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px">
<sc-for list="{{sexeOpts}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="2">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" style="min-height: 50px; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif">{{o.label}}</button>
</sc-for>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700">Ton activité actuelle</span>
<sc-for list="{{niveauOpts}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="4">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" style="min-height: 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; padding: 10px 14px; text-align: left; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700">{{o.label}}</span><span style="font-size: 14px">{{o.sub}}</span></button>
</sc-for>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700">Ton expérience de la musculation</span>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<sc-for list="{{xpOpts}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="3">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" aria-pressed="{{o.on}}" style="min-height: 48px; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif">{{o.label}}</button>
</sc-for>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700">Précautions à connaître</span>
<span style="font-size: 14px; color: #4A4620">Plusieurs choix possibles. Ces réponses restent sur ton téléphone.</span>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px">
<sc-for list="{{precOpts}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="6">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" aria-pressed="{{o.on}}" style="min-height: 48px; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif">{{o.label}}</button>
</sc-for>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</sc-if>
<sc-if value="{{isTest}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; color: #12110C">Le test express</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45">Échauffe-toi 5 minutes avant. Repos de 2 minutes entre les deux premiers tests. Si tu ne peux pas le faire maintenant, donne ton estimation honnête.</p>
<sc-for list="{{testNums}}" as="nf" hint-placeholder-count="2">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #C9C49A; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px">
<label for="{{nf.id}}" style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #12110C">{{nf.label}}</label>
<span aria-live="polite" style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; color: #12110C; white-space: nowrap">{{nf.display}}</span>
</div>
<sc-if value="{{nf.hasDesc}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}"><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #12110C">{{nf.desc}}</span></sc-if>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center">
<button aria-label="{{nf.minusLabel}}" onClick="{{nf.minus}}" style="width: 52px; height: 52px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; background: #E4E1B8; color: #12110C; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer">−</button>
<input id="{{nf.id}}" type="range" min="{{nf.min}}" max="{{nf.max}}" step="{{nf.step}}" value="{{nf.value}}" onChange="{{nf.onRange}}" style="flex-grow: 1; min-width: 0; height: 44px; accent-color: #12110C">
<button aria-label="{{nf.plusLabel}}" onClick="{{nf.plus}}" style="width: 52px; height: 52px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; background: #E4E1B8; color: #12110C; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer">+</button>
</div>
</div>
</sc-for>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #C9C49A; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px">
<span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #12110C">3. Course : combien de temps sans t'arrêter ?</span>
<span style="font-size: 14px">À une allure où tu peux encore parler.</span>
<sc-for list="{{courseOpts}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="4">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" style="min-height: 48px; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif">{{o.label}}</button>
</sc-for>
</div>
</div>
</sc-if>
<sc-if value="{{isGoal}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; color: #12110C">Ton objectif</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45">Un seul objectif principal. On peut tout faire, mais pas tout en même temps.</p>
<sc-for list="{{goalOpts}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="9">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" style="min-height: 64px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; padding: 12px 14px; text-align: left; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase">{{o.family}}</span><span style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700">{{o.label}}</span><span style="font-size: 14px">{{o.sub}}</span></button>
</sc-for>
</div>
</sc-if>
<sc-if value="{{isFreq}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; color: #12110C">La vraie question</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">Combien de fois par semaine peux-tu <b style="color: #12110C">vraiment</b> t'entraîner ? Pas la semaine idéale : une semaine normale, avec le boulot, la famille et la fatigue.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px">
<sc-for list="{{freqOpts}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="6">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" style="min-height: 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">{{o.label}}</span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700">{{o.sub}}</span></button>
</sc-for>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4A4620">Mieux vaut 3 séances tenues toute l'année que 6 abandonnées en février.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700">Combien de temps par séance ?</span>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px">
<sc-for list="{{dureeOpts}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="3">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" aria-pressed="{{o.on}}" style="min-height: 48px; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif">{{o.label}}</button>
